Package: fandyn
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: deniz <onurdenizakan@gmail.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6, systemd
Description: adaptive low-noise fan control for Jetson Nano
 fandynd predicts temperature from its trend and CPU/GPU/RAM load, and
 drives the pwm-fan for the lowest noise that still keeps the board cool.
 Includes quiet, balanced and performance profiles and zero-RPM mode.
